      "MediaThumbURL" : null,
      "ShortDescriptionStr" : "The Project Controls Specialist will be responsible for supporting and managing project control activities across assigned projects, with a focus on cost control, schedule monitoring, forecasting, reporting, risk identification, and variance analysis.\n\nThe role will work closely with project managers, finance, planning, procurement, and delivery teams to ensure accurate project performance tracking, timely reporting, and effective decision-making. The position requires strong analytical skills, hands-on experience with project controls tools, and the ability to maintain alignment between project execution, financial performance, and organizational standards",
